      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِبْرِىٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Hebrew:</i> and <i>a Hebrew</i>]. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِبْرِيُّونَ</span> is
an appellation of <i>The Jews</i> [i. e. <i>the Hebrews</i>].
(O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِبْرِىُّ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِبْرَانِىُّ</span></b> , (S, A, K,)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِبْرِيَّةُ</span> (O) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِبْرَانِيَّةُ</span></b> , (O, TA,) [<i>The
Hebrew language;</i>] <i>the language of the Jews.</i>
(S, A, O, K, TA.)

